        "electricity",
        "primal",
        "sonic"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The living thunderclap emits a bolt of lightning that crashes with deafening thunder. The living thunderclap makes a lightning bolt Strike that deals 1d12 Electricity Damage damage. If it hits, the target and any creatures within a 15ft Type:emanation around the target take 2d6 Sonic Damage damage (Basic DC 18 Fortitude Saving Throw save). Any creature that fails its save is also Deafened for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
